ss!\n\nAny pose and expression is ok\n\nFeatures:\n- Blue eyes, brown rabbit ears\n- Blue streaks on left side of hair\n- Pink streaks on right side of hair\n\nIf you can include the bunny mascot it would be lovely!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1PCAcfDG1rnSIRSW-lNHLw5dnrjr6ICF5/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c2de1d2a/uploads/origins/b6ffbf93-634f-467f-93bd-7bfc5ebfc34d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d662b3f34c5e785853339fe0683e4098", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c2de1d2a/uploads/origins/b6ffbf93-634f-467f-93bd-7bfc5ebfc34d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d662b3f34c5e785853339fe0683e4098, https://si.imgix.net/c2de1d2a/uploads/origins/b6ffbf93-634f-467f-93bd-7bfc5ebfc34d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8f7b19011ee82522d9b6b6500b72fa0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c2de1d2a/uploads/origins/b6ffbf93-634f-467f-93bd-7bfc5ebfc34d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=783fdc7fa3d2be597293c2c10241559e 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "please draw however you'd like! She likes farm animals\n\nhttps://chii.nekoweb.org/kiyomi.jpg", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/24", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c30506b9/uploads/origins/c3755667-0e08-47e8-bb1a-93455f177303?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20f87e5139bc0048d937e36aee84aabc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c30506b9/uploads/origins/c3755667-0e08-47e8-bb1a-93455f177303?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=20f87e5139bc0048d937e36aee84aabc, https://si.imgix.net/c30506b9/uploads/origins/c3755667-0e08-47e8-bb1a-93455f177303?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8e9631f4c2f4def82732f4310b0109a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c30506b9/uploads/origins/c3755667-0e08-47e8-bb1a-93455f177303?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cc9b06d9cfedba12e6b7a1911946fe9c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again omu!\n\nI love your work\n\nI would like you to draw my Vtuber in any way that seems like a celebration! This is her birthday outfit ^_^ You can add a cake, bunnies, or balloons. I leave it to you!\n\nShe is a bunny princess!\n\nAny happy pose and expression is ok\n\nFeatures:\n- Blue eyes, brown rabbit ears\n- Blue streaks on left side of hair\n- Pink streaks on right side of hair\n\nThank you for considering\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1smhEvoScEqpZojLw6SEOGLrck7oOMOjC/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/35cd4811/uploads/origins/d3a0d99c-70d3-4922-8eb7-03b5eb2ebff3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b573c10dc9ebbdc87dab10cfe695ecaf", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/35cd4811/uploads/origins/d3a0d99c-70d3-4922-8eb7-03b5eb2ebff3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b573c10dc9ebbdc87dab10cfe695ecaf, https://si.imgix.net/35cd4811/uploads/origins/d3a0d99c-70d3-4922-8eb7-03b5eb2ebff3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ca8094aaf1d5dbe1ec3a48d5bb98c17 2x, https://si.imgix.net/35cd4811/uploads/origins/d3a0d99c-70d3-4922-8eb7-03b5eb2ebff3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=947427afc9f3bafac417812883e01fae 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\n\nI have been looking at omu's illustrations for a long time, especially the \"Cha Cha\" and \"Guru Guru\" related illustrations on your sub-account, and I really like the way they remind me of the original works of the time.\n\nSo, my main question is, I would like to ask you to draw what is called \"my child\" in the style of omu-sama's illustrations.\n\n\nBelow is the profile of my \"my child\".\n\nProfile\nName︰Chicutis\nAge︰12 years old\nGender︰female\nCharacter︰Sweet and gentle\nRemarks︰She is a witch with black hair.\nShe wears black everyday clothes and white summer clothes.\n\n\nMy child\" is a witch child and I was influenced by \"Cha Cha\" and \"Guru Guru\" in the past.\n\nThe composition of the full body, bust-up, etc. is left up to the artist's discretion.\nI would appreciate it if you could draw her in your own style in a cute way.\n\nPlease refer to the URL for the clothing and other materials.\nYou may choose either black or white clothing.\n\nThank you in advance for your cooperation.\n\nhttps://auto.hanabie.com/sictes-kettei.html", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd84e67d/uploads/origins/a54dbd1e-56b3-41f3-8e14-6d988d0421f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5164687213d6c8128054d57f1068c5b6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/cd84e67d/uploads/origins/a54dbd1e-56b3-41f3-8e14-6d988d0421f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5164687213d6c8128054d57f1068c5b6, https://si.imgix.net/cd84e67d/uploads/origins/a54dbd1e-56b3-41f3-8e14-6d988d0421f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5a1f545fdbab80cfcd457fd8dad10625 2x, https://si.imgix.net/cd84e67d/uploads/origins/a54dbd1e-56b3-41f3-8e14-6d988d0421f2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9d4ce0d873e487179e5878981054ea5a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, too! \n\nI am happy that you like both Yumeyo and Pink-chan. I would be happy to add your illustration to my fan art collection!\n\nI would love a happy illustration of Pink-chan surrounded by sweet treats!\n\nThank you for the appeal and the special price! Your style is very cute.\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/3108568.pink/gallery", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d93206f/uploads/origins/6ec407fd-a364-4be8-a404-667b93869145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51595d92f5bb1c1d1ed445a1f8225b64", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/6d93206f/uploads/origins/6ec407fd-a364-4be8-a404-667b93869145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=51595d92f5bb1c1d1ed445a1f8225b64, https://si.imgix.net/6d93206f/uploads/origins/6ec407fd-a364-4be8-a404-667b93869145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a060e924a15738ea96db63561d2fc059 2x, https://si.imgix.net/6d93206f/uploads/origins/6ec407fd-a364-4be8-a404-667b93869145?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7c08fd1aa6c2ba214e1118586f7d235c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nThank you for your appeal.\nMy name is \"Yukino Umi\" and I am a Vtuber.\nMy motif is a clione.\nI will leave the composition, etc. to you, but I would be happy if you could give me a transparent illustration that I can use for OhaV, etc.\nThank you very much.\n\nhttps://x.com/yukino_umi_21/status/1705900010196660535?s=20", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@omufumiko/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/bc92795c/uploads/origins/a3d4af46-4469-40e9-bdaf-abcbbc512316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65d041ed2492359d30918a330cd81be7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bc92795c/uploads/origins/a3d4af46-4469-40e9-bdaf-abcbbc512316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=65d041ed2492359d30918a330cd81be7, https://si.imgix.net/bc92795c/uploads/origins/a3d4af46-4469-40e9-bdaf-abcbbc512316?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e8